# Database Configuration
# IMPORTANT: You MUST set DATABASE_URL for the application to work

# For Vercel Postgres (Recommended):
# In Vercel, create a Postgres database in Storage tab
# Then set this environment variable in Vercel:
# DATABASE_URL=${POSTGRES_URL}

# For Supabase (Free tier available):
# Get your connection string from Supabase project settings
# Example format:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:[YOUR-PASSWORD]@db.[YOUR-PROJECT].supabase.co:5432/postgres"

# For other PostgreSQL providers (Neon, Railway, etc):
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host:5432/database?schema=public"

# For local development only:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/roblox_logger"
